<title>POLAND: Polish shares close higher in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares close higher in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine stocks rose, five fell and five were flat in 19.7-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade with the WIG 20 index closing at 1,778.9 points, 1.4 percent higher than at the regular session.</p>
<p>NFI units were flat at 165 zlotys, also in a 19.7-million-zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
